{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match the Babies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/1559a792ff14d185e1a128a504543304.poster.avif?t=1768385379\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/1559a792ff14d185e1a128a504543304.webm?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/1559a792ff14d185e1a128a504543304.mp4?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each shift you work the maternity-ward desk. Baby tags and parent cards lie before you; match eye colour and blood type in a simplified genetics puzzle. Accurate work keeps your modest salary coming, while mistakes earn warnings and penalties that can leave you unable to pay rent or buy food.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate the Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/67c6ccff65d2a6d85358fb9486ffe955.poster.avif?t=1768385379\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/67c6ccff65d2a6d85358fb9486ffe955.webm?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/67c6ccff65d2a6d85358fb9486ffe955.mp4?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Colleagues drop by between cases. Branching dialogue choices let you befriend, antagonise, or even romance them. Choose your words carefully: some people are genuinely friendly, but undercover government agents may be testing your loyalty to the regime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face The Consequences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/a1474621c5460489cfc67c1d37600d22.poster.avif?t=1768385379\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/a1474621c5460489cfc67c1d37600d22.webm?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/a1474621c5460489cfc67c1d37600d22.mp4?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every action rewrites tomorrow\u2019s headlines. Friends may vanish, documents may burn, and the story branches toward multiple endings: from quiet survival to revolution. Every character has their own ending, shaped by your choices when your life paths cross. Be ready to face consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive or Thrive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/8a318918b81b50b5cf81ca2c2eaaa980.poster.avif?t=1768385379\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/8a318918b81b50b5cf81ca2c2eaaa980.webm?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/8a318918b81b50b5cf81ca2c2eaaa980.mp4?t=1768385379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Strange things happen during routine work. Will you follow the mysterious lead or pretend you saw nothing? That decision will change the future of New Albion and all its citizens. Support the conspiracy, betray it, play double-agent, or ignore the growing flame of revolution.</p>","background":"